<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Mise à jour de votre demande de vérification - CertiUni</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f6f8;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            color: #333333;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 30px auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }
        .header {
            background-color: #1e3a8a;
            color: #ffffff;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 25px 20px;
        }
        .header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .header p {
            margin: 5px 0 0 0;
            font-size: 13px;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 30px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .greeting {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            color: #111827;
        }
        .status-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 6px 16px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 14px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .status-VERIFIED, .status-APPROVED {
            background-color: #def7ec;
            color: #03543f;
        }
        .status-PENDING, .status-PROCESSING {
            background-color: #fef3c7;
            color: #92400e;
        }
        .status-REJECTED, .status-INVALID {
            background-color: #fde8e8;
            color: #9b1c1c;
        }
        .details-box {
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            border-left: 4px solid #1e3a8a;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;
        }
        .details-item {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .details-item:last-child {
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }
        .details-label {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #4b5563;
        }
        .cta-container {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 30px 0 20px 0;
        }
        .btn {
            background-color: #2563eb;
            color: #ffffff !important;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 12px 28px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 15px;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        .footer {
            background-color: #f3f4f6;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #6b7280;
            border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="header">
            <h1>CertiUni</h1>
            <p>Système de Vérification d'Actes Académiques</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Content -->
        <div class="content">
            <div class="greeting">Bonjour {{requesterName}},</div>
            <p>
                Nous vous informons d'un changement de statut concernant votre demande de vérification de document numéro <strong>#{{requestId}}</strong>.
            </p>

            <!-- Status Badge -->
            <div style="text-align: center; margin: 20px 0;">
                <span class="status-badge status-{{status}}">
                    Statut : {{statusLabel}}
                </span>
            </div>

            <!-- Request & Document Details -->
            <div class="details-box">
                <div class="details-item">
                    <span class="details-label">Référence demande :</span> #{{requestId}}
                </div>
                <div class="details-item">
                    <span class="details-label">Établissement concerné :</span> {{universityName}}
                </div>
                {{#if studentName}}
                <div class="details-item">
                    <span class="details-label">Nom du titulaire :</span> {{studentName}}
                </div>
                {{/if}}
                {{#if documentNumber}}
                <div class="details-item">
                    <span class="details-label">Numéro du document :</span> {{documentNumber}}
                </div>
                {{/if}}
                <div class="details-item">
                    <span class="details-label">Dernière mise à jour :</span> {{updatedAt}}
                </div>
                {{#if remarks}}
                <div class="details-item" style="margin-top: 10px; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px dashed #cbd5e1;">
                    <span class="details-label">Remarques / Observations :</span><br>
                    <span>{{remarks}}</span>
                </div>
                {{/if}}
            </div>

            <!-- CTA -->
            {{#if reportUrl}}
            <div class="cta-container">
                <a href="{{reportUrl}}" class="btn" target="_blank">Consulter le Rapport Complet</a>
            </div>
            {{/if}}
        </div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div class="footer">
            <p>Cet e-mail automatique a été envoyé par la plateforme CertiUni pour le compte de <strong>{{universityName}}</strong>.</p>
            <p>&copy; 2026 CertiUni. Tous droits réservés.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>